  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you click and hold to drag through the QM you will hear a click sound (only if you are above something that you can click on). In the Main Menu doing the same thing will not play the click sound, it will only play when you actually click on something.\nI would suggest to only play the sound when you are clicking on something and not when you are clicking to drag through the menu, just like it is within the Main Menu.\nHere is a video showing what I mean:\nhttps://youtu.be/uf7Cy2IEGeo",
